Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.75,0:01:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.49,0:01:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find them before\NMerrick's rare hunters do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.81,0:01:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.27,0:01:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like to rescue your friends,\Nyou'll have to make it past us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.81,0:01:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's no easy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.09,0:01:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.45,0:01:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I will get past!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm afraid the only way to\Nget by us is to defeat us in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.63,0:01:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and that means you\Nhave to defeat both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.81,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but we have strict\Norders from Master Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.35,0:01:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So, which one of us shall go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.05,0:01:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The honor belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you first. I insist. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.33,0:01:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's draw for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,With our usual game?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.51,0:01:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This always happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.87,0:01:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't happen if you\Nplayed something besides paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.05,0:01:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't you play something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.13,0:01:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.05,0:02:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall defeat you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But as you know, only one of\Nus may duel you at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But not if both of us duel against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.61,0:02:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.71,0:02:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's two on two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We accept your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.17,0:02:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll win both their\NEgyptian god cards at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.73,0:02:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You two won't win. You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is true that the\Nlosing pair will hand over
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,their rarest cards and\Nlocator cards to the winners.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you two pathetic fools believe you'll\Nbe taking our Egyptian god cards away,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you obviously don't know\Nwho you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as you two are out of\Nthe way, I'm dueling you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.75,0:02:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.37,0:02:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time to\Nbegin this duel already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, so we can receive our\Nreward from Master Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.89,0:02:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,for once we defeat you, he'll have all\Nthree Egyptian god cards. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.73,0:03:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who shall begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.33,0:03:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll let you go first, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Conquering you two chumps won't\Ntake very long at all. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.99,0:03:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the magic card, Pot of Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows me to draw\Ntwo cards from my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.11,0:03:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I'll summon a monster\Nknown as the Lord of Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll add not one, but two\Nflutes of summoning dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's the point of all this anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, any amateur knows that one flute can\Nsummon two dragons to the dueling field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So since I have two flutes,\NI can summon four dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.13,0:03:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Four in one turn? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now behold the awesome strength\Nof three blue-eyes white dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus the mighty, the Ozan Rue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you this wouldn't take long. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I must get past them and find my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you realize this is just the beginning\Nof what my deck has in store for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It gets better, so please feel free\Nto forfeit the duel at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I've played one\Nmonster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.89,0:04:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the best you can do, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's all you've got, I\Ncan't wait to battle you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.99,0:04:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then our duel can begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I must make sure\Nmy friends are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.27,0:04:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get on with this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.69,0:04:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Karibo in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Rare Hunter, your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you've got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And once we destroy them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:05:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll hand both of their Egyptian\NGod cards to Master Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.81,0:05:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew Mirror Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.71,0:05:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the card I need for our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing that I'll do is\Nplace this one trap card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.69,0:05:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then a monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to lay a trap,\Nyou're wasting your time and mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare hunters can be cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to end this duel. Well, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back and observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.01,0:05:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare to meet a creature\Nlike none you've seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I will sacrifice my three blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.13,0:05:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, my great beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can summon my Egyptian god card, an\Nalmighty creature that knows no equal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:06:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold its absolute power! Oh no, what's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.43,0:06:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,that the invincible obelisk the tormentor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,you're no match for my egyptian god
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.09,0:06:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,card now behold obelisk the tormentor's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,special ability I sacrificed two more\Nof my monsters to increase his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.59,0:06:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Obelisk, destroy\Nall of their monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He just wiped out our defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my Egyptian god\Ncard, finish them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.31,0:06:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry to disappoint you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.89,0:06:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but Mirror Force will reflect\NObalisk's attack right back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that your weak\Ntrap card won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.99,0:07:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your assistance, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.63,0:07:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can find my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are my friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, don't walk away without\Ntaking your prize first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.07,0:07:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your locator card, catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I must make sure my friends are all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't duel you now, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, Yugi's friends are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact headquarters and tell\Nthem to use our satellite
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.25,0:07:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,system to track the location\Nof that pathetic wannabe,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.21,0:07:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the others will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you find your\Nlittle group of cronies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,for our duel, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.67,0:07:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Our satellites should hone in\Non Joey's duel disk in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.07,0:07:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Master America's about to get his wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:08:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone he wants, all in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the greatest\Nfisherman in all of the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, ah, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.71,0:08:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.57,0:08:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to catch\Nmy lunch when suddenly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,this great beast attacked\Nme from out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an aquarium and you\Nwere stealing his lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling sick enough as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.81,0:08:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.19,0:08:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to catch my daily meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well go before you are a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.65,0:08:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You are burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about the Ocean World show?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.11,0:08:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to be in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in the shape that you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.37,0:08:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm the only person\Nhere the whales will obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear not, for I am one with the sea\Nand all the creatures that inhabit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I shall reach the\Ncenter of Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.47,0:09:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,then it won't be long before the limitless
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.93,0:09:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,power of the pharaoh\Nhimself belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense a familiar dark energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.27,0:09:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,the same force that control bandit Keith,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and my ring detects another\NMillennium item approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to add it to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I shall possess\Nall seven. Hey, Bacora!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.89,0:09:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here to check out some duels?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, how's the\Ntournament progressing so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.31,0:09:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I already scored four locator cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need are two more,\Nand I'll be in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And where's Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.01,0:09:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been looking all over for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.09,0:09:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet he's probably somewhere\Nkicking some serious butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.45,0:09:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and Yugi in the finals battling\Nin the rematch of the century.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you getting ahead\Nof yourself there, champ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I do need to crush a\Ncouple more duelas first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.55,0:10:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.61,0:10:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Mako Tsunami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.07,0:10:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he should be dueling,\Nnot performing with Shamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.05,0:10:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.11,0:10:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll challenge him to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.79,0:10:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Finals, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.23,0:10:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.05,0:10:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Play your foolish games while I become\Nthe most powerful being in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one on the whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.17,0:10:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that's a strange sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.77,0:10:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the lift!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:11:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the great beasts\Nof the sea can be tamed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mako, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, my old friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.93,0:11:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, since Duelist Kingdom, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see you, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.85,0:11:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing performing\Nat the aquarium, Mako?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought you'd be here dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.49,0:11:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here to duel and win, but my\Nkinship with the sea was needed first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hop off Shamu and let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'd be better\Noff just enjoying my show.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your show. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have four locator cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the club, fish boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we shall duel and give all these\Npeople a show to remember. Cheerin' fans?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.33,0:11:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:11:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, they're gonna duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.15,0:12:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's even better than the whales!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this crowd digs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.25,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's do this! Land lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.59,0:12:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Put up two locator cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever wins this goes\Ndirectly to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.63,0:12:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool, taking your cards\Nwill be a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to duel! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.81,0:12:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey, feed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.15,0:12:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I unleash my mighty denizens of\Nthe deep, you'll be all washed up, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a big mouth and\Na short memory, Sharkbait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one fighting\Nin the Duelist Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,finals while you were swimming back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.85,0:12:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, check this out. Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.53,0:12:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a dance or a duel?\NHere we go. It's official.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.39,0:12:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait till he sees this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that parasite card Weevil\Nsnuck in my deck to sabotage me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.95,0:12:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Joey, just keep that adorable game\Nface on and never let him see you sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go already, Guppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move or forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.15,0:13:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit rushing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a chance to\Nback out if you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish, Squidbrain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I can use this thing\Nto infect his monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I place my card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I summon the mighty Flying Fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his face down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to be infected!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.75,0:13:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My parasite didn't work. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because your parasite was weaker\Nthan my monster, allowing me to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.21,0:13:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.61,0:13:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You just wasted your first turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now who's the shark face?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.23,0:13:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:13:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:14:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too embarrassing to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place another card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just getting warmed up before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.35,0:14:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This time it's for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.61,0:14:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and I got a plan that'll leave\Nyour little goldfish high and dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be ready for\Nthis so-called strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.19,0:14:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place a monster face\Ndown as well and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.45,0:14:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see your strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.35,0:14:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, barnacle breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the master!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.41,0:14:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, I'm just trying\Nto give this crowd a good show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.23,0:14:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice my face-down monster in\Norder to summon the ferocious Garoozies!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I activate Torrential Tribute!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he's the most dramatic\Nopponent I've ever faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on little Yugi's\Nfriends, my rare hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be needing all of them very shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You have something I seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.33,0:15:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you're the dark force\Nwhose presence I've been sensing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.35,0:15:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your Millennium Item\Nand you may pass by. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.55,0:15:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You are somewhat familiar\Nwith the ancient ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want my item?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.43,0:15:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you must know, I'm\Na collector of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I possess all\Nseven Millennium items,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll control ancient powers strong\Nenough to rule the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So I will ask you once again to hand\Nover your Millennium rod. Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.31,0:15:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever he is, he has knowledge\Nof the ancient scriptures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.03,0:16:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately for me, this\Nstranger doesn't know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,For he who possesses the boundless\Npower of the pharaoh himself
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,controls a magic far stronger\Nthan the seven millennium items.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.05,0:16:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I told you I had exclusive\Nknowledge of certain secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.59,0:16:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have my millennium\Nrod if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But before I hand it over to you, you\Nhave to do something for me in exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,For I am somewhat of a collector\Nmyself. And once I possess what
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.93,0:16:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I desire The Millennium Rod will\Nmean absolutely nothing to me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take your Millennium Item by\Nforce As I've done to others in the past
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know the whereabouts\Nof several of the Millennium
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Items Including the\NMillennium Necklace worn by my
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,sister Perhaps there is a way\Nwe can work together And help
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.15,0:16:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Each other to get what we want.\NYou've made a wise choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,With our combined power,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,no one in the entire world\Nwill be able to stop us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.43,0:17:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako's fish deck is destroying Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.75,0:17:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying fish, attack my\Nopponent's life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.15,0:17:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll place one card\Nface down and complete my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.81,0:17:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the power of my sea deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.05,0:17:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako Tsunami will show no mercy. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's asking you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.39,0:17:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,For years, I have searched for\Nmy lost father on the open seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have used nothing but\Na small wooden fishing boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I battle the mighty\Nocean waters, I become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And no matter how\Ndifficult the struggle is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.57,0:17:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have vowed never to stop\Nsearching until I find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I face my dueling opponents\Nwith the same determination,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.47,0:17:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and I fight every duel\Nin honor of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:17:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I know in my heart we'll\Nbe reunited someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But until that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,even though he's not right here, he\Ncontinues to inspire me and give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I got someone who inspires\Nme like that also.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My little sister, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And guess what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't show any mercy either, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on with the duel, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.55,0:18:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay calm, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.31,0:18:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.61,0:18:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Alligator's Sword in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.85,0:18:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And I place two more cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn, Flipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.93,0:18:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I underestimated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He is more determined than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.17,0:18:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to teach him a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I'm going to lose is my lunch\Nfrom the smell of all this rotten fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrificed the weaker flying fish in order\Nto summon the stronger amphibian beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not frightened of that tadpole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.43,0:19:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be when amphibian\Nbeast attacks with sea claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate fairy box.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.17,0:19:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did your gator disappear to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.09,0:19:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You never played Whack-A-Crack?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.65,0:19:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very clever, but watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the mighty alligator sword\Ncan't breathe under water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So I play Yumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the water level of this field\Nby covering it with ocean water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.05,0:19:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My alligator's completely\Nsubmerged in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore it has to come up for air.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And that time is now. Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, frog face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.27,0:19:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Skull Dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The number that I roll will determine how
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.79,0:19:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,much your Toad's attack\Npoints get decreased.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.03,0:19:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They get divided by four!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.99,0:19:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Frog Legs, anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that just\Nabout evens the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.37,0:20:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a worthy opponent, Joey. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty worthy yourself there, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But this duel has just begun and\Nthe sea hides many great mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and great terrors,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the most powerful and dangerous creatures\Nof all lie hidden deep beneath its waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I will prevail and obtain my\Nplace in the Battle City Finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.23,0:20:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,for I have a secret weapon\Nguaranteed to destroy him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.05,0:20:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and it waits in the\Ndepths of my ocean deck.
